  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Search is turning into conversations",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white\" aria-labelledby=\"why-title\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"story\">\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"why-title\">Search is turning into <span class=\"accent\">conversations</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"story__body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>People no longer just type keywords and scan a list of links. They ask full questions and get a single, written answer, often with a short list of recommended businesses.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>If your brand isn’t part of that answer, you can miss the buyer completely, even if you rank well in traditional search.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>GEO makes your expertise easy for AI tools to find, understand and quote, so you are part of the conversation when buyers ask about your services.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"tilt-grid tilt-grid--3 why-points\" role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tilt-card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-sparkle\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tilt-card__title\">Be part of the answer</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tilt-card__text\">Help AI assistants mention your business when buyers ask about your services.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tilt-card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-users\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tilt-card__title\">Questions, not keywords</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tilt-card__text\">We plan content around the real questions buyers ask, in the way they ask them.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tilt-card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tilt-card__title\">Stronger SEO too</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tilt-card__text\">Clear, well-structured content helps you in traditional search results as well.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
