  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "How we get you into AI answers",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white methods\" aria-labelledby=\"methods-title\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"methods-title\">How we get you into <span class=\"accent\">AI answers</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">GEO is new, so we stick to what helps AI tools find, understand and trust your brand, and we measure every step.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row__text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"feature-row__title\">We start with what buyers actually ask</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>We collect the full, conversational questions people ask AI assistants about your services and group them by intent.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Prompt research across AI tools</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Grouped by buying intent</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Gaps compared with competitors</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row__visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Question research · Conversational prompts</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><ul class=\"mock-list\"><li><span>“Which agency can help my clinic get more patients online?”</span><span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--info\">High intent</span></li><li><span>“Is GEO worth it for a small business?”</span><span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--muted\">Research</span></li><li><span>“Compare SEO agencies for e-commerce brands”</span><span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--warn\">Comparison</span></li><li><span>“How long does SEO take to show results?”</span><span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--muted\">Research</span></li><li><span>“Best agency to build a booking website”</span><span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--info\">High intent</span></li></ul></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row feature-row--flip\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row__text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"feature-row__title\">Content AI tools can quote</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Clear, well-structured pages that answer those questions directly make it easy for AI tools to cite and recommend you.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Direct answers and FAQs</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Expert, up-to-date facts</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Trusted third-party mentions</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row__visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">AI assistant · Answer preview</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mock-chat\">\n\t<div class=\"mock-chat__q\">Which agencies can help a small clinic get more patients from Google and AI search?</div>\n\t<div class=\"mock-chat__a\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-sparkle\"/></svg></span><div>Here are a few agencies that specialise in this:\n\t\t<ol><li><span class=\"mock-brand\">Your Brand</span>: SEO, AI search and websites for clinics, with clear monthly reporting.</li><li>Competitor A: local SEO and paid ads.</li><li>Competitor B: content marketing.</li></ol>\n\t\t<div class=\"mock-cites\"><span class=\"mock-cite mock-cite--you\">yourbrand.com</span><span class=\"mock-cite\">clutch.co</span><span class=\"mock-cite\">g2.com</span></div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row__text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"feature-row__title\">Help machines understand your business</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Schema markup tells search engines and AI tools exactly who you are, what you offer and where you work.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Organisation and service schema</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> FAQ and article markup</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Consistent brand details everywhere</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row__visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Structured data · JSON-LD</span><span class=\"mock__tag\">Code</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><pre class=\"mock-code\"><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"k\">\"@context\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"https://schema.org\"</span>,\n  <span class=\"k\">\"@type\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"ProfessionalService\"</span>,\n  <span class=\"k\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"Your Brand\"</span>,\n  <span class=\"k\">\"areaServed\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"Worldwide\"</span>,\n  <span class=\"k\">\"knowsAbout\"</span>: [<span class=\"s\">\"SEO\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"GEO\"</span>, <span class=\"s\">\"Web development\"</span>],\n  <span class=\"k\">\"sameAs\"</span>: [<span class=\"s\">\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/yourbrand\"</span>],\n  <span class=\"k\">\"aggregateRating\"</span>: <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"k\">\"ratingValue\"</span>: <span class=\"s\">\"4.9\"</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span></pre></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row feature-row--flip\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row__text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"feature-row__title\">Visits and leads from AI tools</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>We separate AI referral traffic in GA4 and track the enquiries it brings, alongside regular AI visibility checks.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> AI referral tracking in GA4</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Monthly visibility checks</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Leads attributed to AI search</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"feature-row__visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">GA4 · Traffic from AI tools</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mock-bars\"><div class=\"mock-bar mock-bar--you\"><span>chatgpt.com</span><em><i style=\"width:100%\"></i></em><span class=\"num\">1,240</span></div><div class=\"mock-bar\"><span>perplexity.ai</span><em><i style=\"width:52%\"></i></em><span class=\"num\">640</span></div><div class=\"mock-bar\"><span>gemini.google.com</span><em><i style=\"width:34%\"></i></em><span class=\"num\">420</span></div><div class=\"mock-bar\"><span>copilot.microsoft.com</span><em><i style=\"width:15%\"></i></em><span class=\"num\">190</span></div></div><p class=\"mock__heading\" style=\"margin-top:1.1rem\">Leads from AI referrals</p><div class=\"mock-stats mock-stats--3\"><div class=\"mock-stat mock-stat--violet\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Leads</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">58</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +41</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Conversion rate</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">2.3%</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +0.9 pts</span></div><div class=\"mock-stat\"><div class=\"mock-stat__label\">Avg. engagement</div><div class=\"mock-stat__value\">2m 48s</div><span class=\"mock-up\">▲ +35%</span></div></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "geo",
    "modules": []
   }
