  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "GEO built on solid SEO",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white\" aria-labelledby=\"choose-title\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container why\">\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"choose-title\">GEO built on <span class=\"accent\">solid SEO</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">AI tools lean on the same signals as search engines: clear content, a healthy website and a trusted brand. We work on all three.</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"why__actions\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button button--primary button--lg\" href=\"#proposal\">Request a proposal <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow-right\"/></svg></a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"bento\" role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"bento__card bento__card--dark\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-tile icon-tile--dark\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"bento__title\">SEO and GEO together</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>One plan for search results and AI answers, so the work supports both.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"bento__card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-code\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"bento__title\">Technical work done in-house</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our developers handle schema, speed and site structure, not just the advice.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"bento__card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-chart\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"bento__title\">Honest reporting</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>GEO is new, so we’re clear about what can and can’t be measured yet.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"bento__card bento__card--dark\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-tile icon-tile--dark\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-key\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"bento__title\">You own everything</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Your content, accounts and data always stay in your name.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "geo",
    "modules": []
   }
