  {
   "name": "intella/faq",
   "attrs": {
    "background": "cream",
    "anchor": "",
    "title": "GEO questions, <em>answered</em>",
    "lead": "Can’t find your answer? Ask us on a free 30-minute call.",
    "buttonText": "Contact us",
    "buttonUrl": "/contact/",
    "items": [
     {
      "question": "What is GEO?",
      "answer": "GEO stands for generative engine optimisation. It’s the work of helping your business get mentioned and recommended in answers from AI tools like ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity and Google’s AI Overviews."
     },
     {
      "question": "Is GEO different from SEO?",
      "answer": "They overlap a lot. SEO focuses on ranking in search results; GEO focuses on being quoted in AI answers. Strong SEO foundations make GEO work better, so we usually plan them together."
     },
     {
      "question": "Can you guarantee my business will appear in ChatGPT?",
      "answer": "No. AI tools decide their own answers, and they change often. We focus on the things that make you more likely to be included, and we report honestly on what we see."
     },
     {
      "question": "How do you measure GEO results?",
      "answer": "We track how often AI tools mention your brand for your key questions, visits that come from AI tools, and the enquiries those visits bring. Measurement in this area is still developing, and we’ll be clear about its limits."
     },
     {
      "question": "Do I need GEO if my SEO is already good?",
      "answer": "Good SEO is a great start. If your buyers research with AI assistants, GEO helps make sure your brand is part of those answers too."
     }
    ],
    "buttonStyle": "outline"
   }
  },
